  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "养胃粥和员工食堂  (Stomach-Soothing Porridge and Canteen Vouchers)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Still at Chun Yuqiao's bedside, Bu Xiaogu asks about his chronic stomach trouble and offers to cook porridge—only for Chun Yuqiao to gently roast her home cooking. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你这个胃病怎么这么严重？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "老毛病了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "多久了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "三年，没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "凯文和杏子总是有事不告诉我，你刚来不要养成这样的坏习惯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "到底出什么事了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真没事，我就是担心你，所以过来看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我妈做的养胃粥可好喝了，我可以给你做，想喝吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你每天带过来的饭，我都看见了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我让行政给你多加了一份餐券，以后中午你就在员工食堂吃。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "晚上最好不要吃自己做的饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要是不想变成我这样，要么好好练练你的厨艺，要么就别下厨房了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明白！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你这个胃病怎么这么严重？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did your stomach trouble get so severe?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "老毛病了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It is an old ailment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "多久了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How long have you had it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "三年，没事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Three years—it is fine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "凯文和杏子总是有事不告诉我，你刚来不要养成这样的坏习惯。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen and Xingzi always hide trouble from me; you just joined, so do not pick up that bad habit.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "到底出什么事了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What actually happened at the office?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真没事，我就是担心你，所以过来看看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nothing at all—I was just worried about you, so I came by to see you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我妈做的养胃粥可好喝了，我可以给你做，想喝吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'My mum's stomach-soothing porridge tastes wonderful; I can make it for you—would you like some?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你每天带过来的饭，我都看见了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have seen the lunches you bring to the office every day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我让行政给你多加了一份餐券，以后中午你就在员工食堂吃。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I had admin add an extra meal voucher for you—eat lunch in the staff canteen from now on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "晚上最好不要吃自己做的饭。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'And in the evening you had better avoid eating your own cooking.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要是不想变成我这样，要么好好练练你的厨艺，要么就别下厨房了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unless you want a stomach like mine, either practise your cooking properly or stay out of the kitchen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明白！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Understood!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你这个胃病怎么这么严重？",
      "gap": 0.5
