      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你每天带过来的饭，我都看见了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我让行政给你多加了一份餐券，以后中午你就在员工食堂吃。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "晚上最好不要吃自己做的饭。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你要是不想变成我这样，要么好好练练你的厨艺，要么就别下厨房了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "明白！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Even while teasing Bu Xiaogu's culinary skills, Chun Yuqiao quietly made sure she gets hot canteen meals every day. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
